/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/deployments","created_at":"2026-11-15T01:10:49Z","updated_at":"2026-11-20T09:38:50Z","pushed_at":"2026-11-24T14:33:09Z","git_url":"git://github.com/openwizdev/WizSite.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:openwizdev/WizSite.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/openwizdev/WizSite.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/openwizdev/WizSite","homepage":"","size":205874,"stargazers_count":1,"watchers_count":1,"language":"JavaScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":61,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["agent-factory","cloudflare-pages","landing-page","open-source","static-site","website"],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":61,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/pulls/179","html_url":"https://github.com/openwizdev/WizSite/pull/179","diff_url":"https://github.com/openwizdev/WizSite/pull/179.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/openwizdev/WizSite/pull/179.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-24T11:49:33Z"},"body":"Implements ticket openwizdev/OpenWiz#2965 (BK3 of spec #2963) against `book`.\n\n## What I built\n- `lib/book/mail.js`:\n  - `icsFor(booking, env)`: generates a valid single-event RFC 5545 `VCALENDAR` with UTC timestamps, CRLF endings, UTF-8-aware 75-octet folding, text escaping, `UID` `<id>@openwiz.dev`, `SUMMARY:OpenWiz call`, and `LOCATION` when `BOOK_MEETING_URL` is set.\n  - `sendBookingMail(env, booking, { fetch })`: sends fixed-template plain text + dark HTML confirmation via Resend (`POST https://api.resend.com/emails`, 10 s timeout, `Idempotency-Key` from booking id, default `BOOK_FROM` `OpenWiz <book@openwiz.dev>`) with visitor timezone (falling back to `America/Los_Angeles`) and Pacific time, 30-minute duration, meeting link or fallback line, cancel link, and `.ics` attachment; strips all visitor-typed text from the visitor message; sends an HTML-escaped owner notice with `reply_to` to `BOOK_OWNER_EMAIL` when set; returns `'sent'`, `'skipped'` (no `RESEND_API_KEY`), or `'failed'` based on the visitor message outcome and never throws.\n  - `sendCancelMail(env, booking, { fetch })`: same two recipients, same anti-relay and escaping rules, distinct idempotency keys, and same three outcomes.\n- `lib/book/google.js`:\n  - `googleReady(env)`: returns `true` only when `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID`, `GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET`, and `GOOGLE_REFRESH_TOKEN` are all non-empty.\n  - `googleBusy(env, fromMs, toMs, { fetch })`: refreshes the access token (10 s timeout), queries Google's free/busy API (`BOOK_GOOGLE_CALENDAR` defaulting to `primary`), and returns merged ascending `[{ start, end }]` intervals; any failure throws `Error` with `code = 'calendar_unreadable'` without leaking secrets, tokens, or response bodies.\n  - `googleInsert(env, booking, { fetch })`: inserts the event (`OpenWiz call: <name>`, email and team in description, visitor attendee, `sendUpdates=none`, deterministic SHA-256 hex event id derived from `booking.id`, idempotent on 409) and returns the event id or `null` on failure.\n  - `googleDelete(env, eventId, { fetch })`: deletes with `sendUpdates=none`, returning `true` on 2xx/404/410 and `false` otherwise.\n- `tests/book-out.test.mjs`: proof-first unit tests (red first in `a558e21`, green in `956f7cd`) against a fake `fetch`, asserting exact requests, `.ics` round-trip parsing (CRLF, 75-octet folding, escaping), visitor anti-relay stripping, owner HTML escaping, no-key skip, all failure paths (timeout, non-2xx, malformed JSON, calendar errors), secret non-leakage, and zero console output.\n\n## Proof\n\n### `node --test tests/book-out.test.mjs`\n```text\n✔ icsFor: generates valid folded RFC 5545 VCALENDAR that parses back (2.174932ms)\n✔ icsFor: omits LOCATION when BOOK_MEETING_URL is not set (0.548321ms)\n✔ sendBookingMail: returns skipped with no RESEND_API_KEY and makes no requests (1.177619ms)\n✔ sendBookingMail: sends visitor confirmation with .ics and owner notice with escaped fields (32.53763ms)\n✔ sendBookingMail: visitor message never carries visitor-typed markup or URLs; owner HTML escapes them (1.434734ms)\n✔ sendBookingMail: skips owner email when BOOK_OWNER_EMAIL is unset (0.862855ms)\n✔ sendBookingMail: result is visitor outcome even when owner mail fails (1.315377ms)\n✔ sendBookingMail: failure paths (timeout, non-2xx, malformed JSON) return failed without throwing (1.977365ms)\n✔ sendCancelMail: skips without key, sends both recipients, strips visitor text, handles failures (3.249333ms)\n✔ googleReady: true only when all three Google credentials are non-empty (0.256725ms)\n✔ googleBusy: exchanges refresh token, queries freeBusy, merges overlapping intervals ascending (0.942244ms)\n✔ googleBusy: any failure throws Error with code calendar_unreadable and leaks nothing (1.889267ms)\n✔ googleInsert: inserts event with deterministic id, sendUpdates=none, and handles retry 409 (6.048164ms)\n✔ googleInsert: returns null on any failure without throwing (1.078951ms)\n✔ googleDelete: true on 204/404/410, false on failures without throwing (0.912185ms)\nℹ tests 15\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 15\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 107.250909\n```\n\n### `npm run build && npm run check && npm test`\n```text\nStatic site: 106 public files in dist/ (...)\nPASS: pinned WebP artwork and spec recording within budget; the launch video within its own budget\nPASS: exact export, local links/fragments, CSS resources, fonts/licences, copy and privacy\nRan 54 tests in 253.529s\nOK\n```\n\n### `python3 -I tools/comment-check/check.py diff --base origin/book`\n```text\ncomment-check: ok\n```\n\nBuilt with [Cloudroom](https://cloudroom.dev)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/issues/179/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openwizdev/WizSite/issues/179/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]